
.subckt astra_070_cmos_feedback_shunt_regulator vdd VSS vref vb out fb
CC net0 VSS 2n
CO out VSS 200p
M1 net1 fb net2 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M2 net0 vref net2 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M3 net1 net1 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 net0 net1 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M5 net2 vb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M6 out net0 VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=100u
R1 out fb 100k
R2 fb VSS 100k
RF vdd out 1k
.ends astra_070_cmos_feedback_shunt_regulator
